    {
      "path": "apps/api/interview_plan.py",
      "line": 121,
      "value": "'Decide from new information in the ENTIRE CURRENT message, not earlier story details. Use reply_only for a name-only introduction, greeting, farewell, or a conversational pause/stop without new story facts. Current distress about recounting alone (such as 这让我难受) is reply_only, not a new life event. Stopping the entire exchange today (今天就到这里 or 先停一下) is conversational control, not a lasting topic exclusion. Setting aside a named topic temporarily (such as 先不聊厨房 or set the kitchen aside for now) is a topic/privacy update and requires extract. Do not re-extract earlier memories on a whole-exchange pause. Use extract for new memory clues, corrections, topic/privacy exclusions or pauses, language/profile changes, or photo discussion. If new story facts precede a stop, use extract while stopped=true with no question.'"
